    "about_problem": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>You already own an aesthetic. Elevated basics, heavyweight fabric, nothing shouting for attention.</p><p>What you don't have is a system — a set of pieces you trust enough to stop thinking about.</p><p>Instead: a closet full of options and the same question every morning. What actually fits. What actually holds up wash after wash.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text"
      ],
